### Bought assets ###
# The meshes of the robes, and their sheets, were bought. What the tools write
# around them is ours and stays; the meshes and the pictures do not go into a public repository.
# tools/gen_robe.py puts them back.
src/main/resources/assets/alchemia/models/entity/*/*.obj
# every sheet here is a bought one or made out of one, so the pattern rather than a list
src/main/resources/assets/alchemia/textures/entity/robe*.png
